  "body": "## This relates to...\n\nFixes #5974\n\n## Rationale\n\nWith a cold cache (or right after a record expires), every concurrent request to the same hostname kicked off its own DNS lookup.\n\n## Changes\n\n### Features\n\nN/A\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- In-flight lookups are now shared per hostname plus the lookup options that affect resolution. Each request still runs `pick` on the shared records.\n- The in-flight entry is cleared on success and on error, so a failed lookup isn't cached and the next request retries.\n- Added tests for sharing, not caching failures, and not coalescing different hostnames or options.\n\n### Breaking Changes and Deprecations\n\nN/A\n\n## Status\n\n- [x] I have read and agreed to the [Developer's Certificate of Origin][cert]\n- [x] Tested\n- [ ] Benchmarked (**optional**)\n- [ ] Documented\n- [x] Review ready\n- [ ] In review\n- [ ] Merge ready\n\n[cert]: https://github.com/nodejs/undici/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#developers-certificate-of-origin\n",
